WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.340
- So Toheeb, your mama's dream

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.410
was for you to be the UK's first

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.970
Black prime minister, right?
- Yep.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:06.840
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.216
- Have you let her down, you feel?

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:09.049
- Disappointed, 100%.

00:00:09.049 --> 00:00:10.920
Like, 'cause that was
the route that I was on.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.200
I was like a super academic kid in school

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.820
and then like, just for some reason,

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.650
just decided to u-turn into acting.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.320
And for her it must have been
insanely surprising though.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.153
'Cause it's like,

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.380
suddenly your kid just
might as well have told you

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.680
he wants to be a clown
and go to clown school.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.360
And yeah, but, you know,
I went to drama school

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.228
and once you know, we started
on our way with acting,

00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:32.760
she was insanely supportive.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.110
So my thing was always,

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.000
I'm not gonna be the UK's
first Black prime minister

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.860
but I might play him in a show one day.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:38.693
- I know, that's-

00:00:38.693 --> 00:00:40.080
I'm so curious.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.860
Like, that's such a cool thing
to be active in as a kid.

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.740
Like, what do you think
made you pivot into acting?

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.110
- I mean, I had some
really dope teachers, but-

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.450
I don't know, I think there's
something about, you know,

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.120
like, being a kid with a funny accent.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.200
I came from Nigeria.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.680
And there's something about
performing that is a way to-

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.510
You know, you can hide in
your characters, I guess.

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.700
And so like that became a
thing where it was like,

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.830
I didn't feel so isolated
when I was a part of a company

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.779
or, you know, doing plays
or hiding in a character.

00:01:07.779 --> 00:01:10.560
And so yeah, that kind
of just became my escape

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:11.393
in a little way.

00:01:11.393 --> 00:01:13.050
And then it became the
thing where I was like,

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:16.560
if I am doing law every day
for the rest of my life,

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:17.670
I'm gonna be pretty miserable,

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:20.820
but if I'm doing this thing,
then I might not be that sad.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:22.710
- Well, I can tell your
mom is super proud.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:23.580
I'm a mama.
- I hope so.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.754
- Yeah, you're proud anytime
your kid finds themselves.

00:01:25.754 --> 00:01:28.440
Or finds themself? Themselves?
How many are in there?

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.660
Finds themself and really
loves what they're doing

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:31.500
and is passionate about it.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.333
That's cool.

00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:33.180
- You're also making money.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.860
- Yeah, there's that.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.758
I mean, I've moved out,
like you know what I mean?

00:01:36.758 --> 00:01:37.591
I can afford to live with myself.

00:01:37.591 --> 00:01:38.970
- It's like oh, he can afford to do this.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:40.590
- My brother and I might be eating bread

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:43.320
and water every day, but-
- Oh my god, I lived on ramen.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.677
I lived on ramen.

00:01:44.677 --> 00:01:46.470
- Have you ever tried Indomie?

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.420
It's like Nigerian ramen noodles.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.253
- [Kelly] No.

00:01:49.253 --> 00:01:50.490
- I'm going to find a way

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:51.840
to grab you some and get you some.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:52.673
I mean, you probably don't need-

00:01:52.673 --> 00:01:53.506
- I love ramen.
- Yeah?

00:01:53.506 --> 00:01:55.380
- Yeah, I try everything.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.610
I was very lucky.

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:59.370
So from 19 I ended up traveling
like, all over the world

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.870
so I've been to a lot of different places.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.100
So I'll try anything.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.810
I won't love everything, but I'll try it.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:04.839
- Let me know how you feel.
- Yeah.

00:02:04.839 --> 00:02:05.672
- I'm actually gonna, yeah-

00:02:05.672 --> 00:02:06.960
That's my mission, I'm
gonna get you some Indomie

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.310
- Okay, I like this mission.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.143
I'm willing to do this.

00:02:09.143 --> 00:02:10.296
- Do I get some?

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.170
(audience laughs)

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:12.179
- [Toheeb] That was a given, man.

00:02:12.179 --> 00:02:13.297
- [Kelly] He's gonna bring it to improv.

00:02:13.297 --> 00:02:16.290
- [Toheeb[ Everyone I meet gets,
gets Indomie automatically.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:17.123
- Perfect.

